        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Necrotic Decay"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy, negative)\n\nWhen the shanrigol behemoth dies, its flesh rots away and sublimates into a foul-smelling gas that fills a 5-foot emanation around the body. This gas deals 9d6 negative damage to creatures in this area as their flesh curdles and rots as well (27 basic Fortitude save)."
            },
            "id": "ed843638-10cc-4b96-b5ef-d1240f0ab287",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:58:49.088779"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Shred Flesh"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "A shanrigol behemoth's attacks brutally rend its foes. Creatures critically hit by the shanrigol's fleshy slap Strike take an additional 2d6 persistent bleed damage and are enfeebled 1 for as long as they are bleeding."
            },
            "id": "9bff2924-c300-4c25-8ad9-97c4d9dd3781",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:58:49.088779"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Web Trap"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "A creature hit by the shanrigol behemoth's web attack is immobilized and stuck to the nearest surface until it can Escape (25)."
            },
